  "description": "IBOGEN crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H84 N4 O18 Tb4,2(C20 H24 N2 O2),2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.659-3.877 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.20-109.78°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4(μ3-OH)2L2(acac)6]·2H2L·2CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
